cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use OOD-PerceptionBench, please cite both the software and the paper."
title: "OOD-PerceptionBench"
abstract: >-
  A closed-loop CARLA benchmark that separates visual (appearance) from
  geometric (shape/size) out-of-distribution shifts for end-to-end driving
  policies, over 475 routes in three interaction categories, with per-route
  baseline records for 17 published models.
type: software
version: "0.9.0"
date-released: "2026-08-03"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/farrosalferro/OODPerceptionBench"
url: "https://github.com/farrosalferro/OODPerceptionBench"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# VERSION STAMP (coordinator standing rule 1)
# v0.9.0 corresponds to arXiv v1 of the paper below. v1.0.0 will correspond to
# arXiv v2, after the non-redistributable props are replaced and the affected
# routes re-run. Scores from the two versions are not comparable on those props.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

